# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> uci
# UCI uci/id and the owner's name and version decision.
< id name fisher {version}
# UCI id and the owner's author decision.
< id author Fernando Bandeira
# UCI uciok follows the identification.
< uciok
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok.
< readyok
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
